<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 312 days of 1996:</p>
<p>---------------------------1996------1995----Pct Chg  Gasoline..................7,848.....7,788......0.8</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,372.....3,181......6.0</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............851.......837......1.7</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,585.....1,499......5.7</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,545.....4,338......4.8</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,201....17,642......3.2</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,476.....6,561.....-1.3</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,561.....7,256......4.2</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......14,162....13,980......1.3</p>
</text>
